{
  "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "hanyuan",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liqinghe",
    "shenheng",
    "tangjian",
    "hetaihou"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "按三席具名理由得出实际授位结果，只有获授者可以亲口拒绝",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "观里的灯燃过一夜。次晨，你到含元殿听查证的结果。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门槛的露水还没干，三位评议官已把封好的凭据摆上案。你和李同时起身。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l3",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "昨日要花的钱都办了。三位各查过凭据，先读比较的项目，再读支持谁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一项项听。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l5",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "殿上另设了女皇的御席。何太后移到监议的位置，案前留下两条进退的路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "四处都收到延期告知，两处请人代送的，也已收到第一件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两处确实办起来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可查卷的人跟着出去了，改前改后的原稿没能再对一遍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "减了开支，眼前的钱够了。前后的卷子也都对完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两件都办完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "新设的代送没办。暂缓的告知已经送去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "代送已收到文书，前后卷子也对完了。本轮余钱已经花出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下月还得找钱接着办。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下月接续要用的钱，还没拿到准拨的凭据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "六处仍待添办。原提案附着，没另换名目添钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没办成的，照实记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "每个人亲自确认的署名在此。证人的细节另外封着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这轮没有重新对过的地方，没有盖上已查的印。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原件还封着，仍写待查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能说查清了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "当事人没回来确认的署名，不能替填，也不能算查全。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "柳做事的凭据另附着。你准许简录只列自己的话，也记了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "简录得更正，不能说那些错是你亲自查的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "柳做了什么、你总管什么，并列着，双方也都确认了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l27",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "各人做的，各认各的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l28",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没把她查的，说成你亲自查的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l29",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "管钱的官员并排摆好两份收支，指着拨款日期。唐照她署名的评语念。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "钱这一项，支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "减了要办的地方，眼前的钱已到；李令仪添办的钱还得等下月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "钱这一项，支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "减下开支后，钱够办完这一轮。李令仪眼前要用的钱，还没拨齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "钱这一项，支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先听钱的来处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l38",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "各署给李令仪合拨的数目已准，{名}下月新增的开支还没着落。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l39",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "钱这一项，支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l40",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "接着念理由。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l41",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "李令仪那两处能接着办。{名}手里的钱，开不了六处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l42",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "管收文书的官员取出昨日的收件凭据。一枚掌印压歪了，已请本人补认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l43",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能不能把文书递进来，这一项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l44",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "来看人有没有被拦在外头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l45",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两处能自己递，也有人代送。李令仪那两处只有轮班收件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l46",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能不能把文书递进来，这一项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l47",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "昨日第一件已经送到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l48",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "请人代送的已收到第一件。李令仪给远处代送的，还没办起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l49",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能不能把文书递进来，这一项支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l50",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "照办成的来说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l51",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "李令仪两处已轮班收件，{名}新办代送的事却缓下了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l52",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能不能把文书递进来，这一项支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l53",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "六处还没开，不能凭数目多就算赢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l54",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是，六处还没开门。多写四处，不能多算四处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l55",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "查错案的官员分开放好初稿与改稿，把证人确认过的署名夹在中间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l56",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "错办的事能否查改，这一项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l57",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "请念怎么查过的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l58",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "反对的那页、前后改稿和本人署名，全已对过。哪里退改，都能查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l59",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "错办的事能否查改，这一项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l60",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两个人留着查完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l61",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "对。两人把经手者确认的署名都对过，谁改哪处，都留得下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l62",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "错办的事能否查改，这一项支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l63",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我这边查完的，凭据在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l64",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "李令仪前后已对完。{名}的人派了出去，还少这一步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l65",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true,
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "错办的事能否查改，这一项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l66",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true,
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一项请照查过的算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l67",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true,
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "本人确认的署名随原稿查过了。但这一项，不能替六处添出钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l68",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true,
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "错办的事能否查改，这一项支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l69",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true,
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也请把还没办到的念出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l70",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true,
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "{名}还缺本人的署名确认。李令仪这边，已查完一轮。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l71",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我说三日内查回，可还没全部试过。这句保留的话，也念。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l72",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三日能否办完，仍有疑处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l73",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已经念了，照实留下。今次支持这一项，不等于往后都准成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l74",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_evidence_majority": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "{名}两项，李令仪一项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l75",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_evidence_majority": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这次比较，我得了两项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l76",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_evidence_majority": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三位已署名奏请授位，陛下看过了。"
